    {
      "id": "p0076-b013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although this simplified Japanese style has a retro feel to it, the lack of kanji also lends it an immature or \"grade schooler\" vibe. This combination led some fans to criticize the official translation as feeling too \"kiddie\" and/or old-fashioned.",
